    "reason": "64 KiB minimizes cold range overfetch; 4 MiB bounds publication/recovery working sets. Coalescing makes smaller blocks use the same GET for consecutive selected blocks. 16 MiB remains configurable for sequential-heavy streams. Latency varied across routed instances and is not a reliable ranking here."
